      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present 47 Northcliffe, Chapelizod, Dublin 20 to the market a superb one-bedroom apartment ideally positioned within this mature and highly sought-after development in the heart of Chapelizod Village. Few locations offer such an enviable lifestyle, with a fantastic selection of cafés, restaurants, traditional pubs and local shops all just a short stroll from the front door. One of the development's most unique features is its private gated access directly into the magnificent Phoenix Park, offering endless opportunities for walking, cycling and outdoor recreation. The area is also exceptionally well connected with numerous Dublin Bus routes nearby, while the N4, M50 and Dublin City Centre are all within easy reach.\n\nBright and well-proportioned internal living accommodation comprises of entrance hallway, spacious lounge with access to a private balcony, fully fitted kitchen, generous double bedroom and bathroom. The property benefits from gas fired central heating and offers a practical layout with excellent natural light throughout.\n\nNo. 47 comes to the market as a blank canvas, presenting the successful purchaser with an excellent opportunity to modernise and create a stylish home tailored to their own taste and specification. Additional features include a private storage unit, parking and a private balcony, all of which further enhance the appeal of this superb property.\n\nWhether you're a first-time buyer, investor or someone looking to downsize, No. 47 offers an outstanding opportunity to acquire a home in one of Dublin 20's most desirable and unique developments. Combining excellent potential, a fantastic village setting and exclusive access to Phoenix Park, early viewing is highly recommended contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to arrange a viewing!\n\nAdditional Features;\n• c. 41 sqm\n• BER F\n• 1 Bed / 1 Bath\n• 1st Floor apartment\n• Management fees c. 1,660 p/a\n• Parking\n• Gas heating\n• Fully fitted kitchen\n• Private balcony\n• Private entrance to the Phoenix Park\n• Own storage unit\n• Bright and airy\n• Plenty of transport links nearby\n• Wide range of local amenities within walking distance\n• Highly sought after location\n• Ideal for first time buyers and downsizers\n• Viewing highly advised!"
      },
      {
